Locate and label these three iron and steel centres on an outline political map of India:

**A.** the integrated plant in Chhattisgarh built with Soviet collaboration in the 1950s;

**B.** the plant at the foot of the Shevaroy hills in Tamil Nadu;

**C.** the steel city where the Subarnarekha and Kharkai rivers meet in Jharkhand.
